@page "/Apps/MerryCountdown"
@model MZikmund.Web.Pages.Apps.MerryCountdownSupportModel
@{
    MetaTags.Title = "Merry Countdown support";
}

<div class="prose-page prose">
    <h1>Merry Countdown support</h1>

    <p>Merry Countdown (in Czech, <span lang="cs">Čekání na Vánoce</span>) is a Christmas countdown, advent calendar and
        wish list for families.</p>

    <h2>Need help?</h2>
    <p>Write to <a href="mailto:appstore@zikmund.dev">appstore@zikmund.dev</a>. Please mention your device and the app
        version, which helps a lot in tracking things down.</p>

    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <h3>How do I restore my Pro purchase?</h3>
    <p>Open Settings (the gear), then Get the full version, then Restore purchases. Pro is a one-time purchase, not a
        subscription, so there is nothing to renew.</p>

    <h3>What is the grown-up check?</h3>
    <p>A simple multiplication question that guards purchases, videos and sharing, so little ones can't wander off
        into them by accident.</p>

    <h3>Where is my data stored?</h3>
    <p>Everything stays on your device. There are no accounts, no ads and no tracking.</p>

    <h3>Which platforms are supported?</h3>
    <p>Windows, Android, iPhone and iPad.</p>

    <h2>Legal</h2>
